  WITHOUT: 7.0 tools avg
  WITH:    9.6 tools avg (+37%)
  → 3+ RIM calls, but adds efficiency on Q6

Multi-hop architectural (RIM beneficial):
  WITHOUT: 9.5 tools avg
  WITH:    5.5 tools avg (-42%)
