"""
Data validation gates for repository intelligence platform.

GATE 1 — Storage/Persistence: Cross-verify PostgreSQL ↔ Azure ↔ Repository
GATE 2 — Symbol Extraction: Inspect and cross-check extracted symbols
GATE 3 — Tools: Test harness for real repository inspection tools
