      Case B: Rejected plan -> 400 Bad Request
      Case C: Stale approval (v1 approved, replanned to v2) -> 400 Bad Request
      Case D: Valid approved plan -> 200 OK
      Case E: Unauthorized user -> 403 Forbidden
    """
