  │   ├→ _search_semantic(query)       [ChromaDB if available]
  │   └→ Fusion via RRF
  │
  └→ [if empty] _retrieve_with_fallback()
      ├→ QueryExpander.decompose_query()
      ├→ _retrieve_primary() on each term
      └→ Return fused results
```

